sail.me - Boat & Yacht Rentals Worldwide. Search & Book a boat for your next adventure.

Unforgettable boat trips start with sail.me. Find boat rentals, yacht charters, and amazing adventures across the globe and new places to visit near or far away from you. Book the perfect boat for your trip, or start earning money as a Boat Owner.

BOOK BOAT RENTALS
Search through thousands of boat rentals: motorboats, sailboats, catamarans, and luxury yachts. Filter by boat type, length, price, crew or trip duration. Choose your dates, and rent a boat, or charter a yacht on your terms.

BOATING EXPLORATION GUIDE
Explore the world’s most beautiful boating spots & find destination guides for the
perfect boat trip!

sail.me is a community built by boat lovers for boat lovers. With sail.me you can
enjoy features like: 

AS A TRAVELER
• Discover and plan all your future adventures on board the world’s best boats;
• Book a boat for your next solo, family or group journey;
• Find your next favorite boating location in our Destinations Guide;
• Save your ideal boat rentals to your account and invite friends and family to plan
the trip with you;
• Search throughout boats with additional services and itineraries to spoil even more
your trip;
• Message the boat owner and get directions to the boat and marinas;
• Book and Pay through our secure payment system;

AS A BOAT OWNER
Do you own a boat you only use a couple of times a year, but are you still paying for high maintenance fees and port taxes? Now you can start making money while doing your business. Join the sail.me fast-growing boat rentals marketplace and publish your Boat Listing to start earning from your boat:
• Share your boat with Renters and earn money from it by listing it;
• Set different prices in your boat’s price & availability calendar;
• Manage your boats easily, track expenses and issue invoices;
• Message renters and manage their reservations;
• Fast and Easy and Secure online payments;

POPULAR DESTINATIONS
Explore the world’s best boating destinations on a chartered yacht! Browse the most beautiful boat destinations around the globe in our guide.
• USA & Canada - Boat rentals have never been more accessible. Rent a yacht in Miami, enjoy a beautiful sunset on a pontoon rental in San Diego, or go wakeboarding on some of the great lakes
• Croatia & Greece - Sail to the birthplace of Marco Polo - Korcula or explore the 4000 Greek islands by water
• France & Italy - The French Riviera is one of the most luxurious places to rent a boat, and why not travel through over 4700 miles of glorious Mediterranean coastline of Italy.
•  Caribbean & Mexico - Are you ready for an adventure from Cancun to Isla Mujeres? Discover the beauty of Mexican Caribbean while you enjoy your drink onboard a catamaran charter or an amazing powerboat.

POPULAR ACTIVITIES
sail.me offers additional water experiences to our boat rental ones. What is a boat party without drinks, food, or even a DJ? Spending some family time together - wakeboarding, surfing, jet skis and many more are a perfect way to enjoy the get-togethers. And if you are planning your next vacation, why go for a boring hotel room when you can rent a catamaran or houseboat to spend the night in the sea. Whether you join a whale-watching tour, fishing charter or observe sea life from ashore, this is an amazing and unforgettable experience that lives in your memory forever.
And for extra special events we’ve got the most luxurious yacht charters at your disposal.
